---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /services/
title: "Services | Strategy, Projects, AI, Planning & Systems | RaeAligned"
description: "Business strategy, project management, AI enablement, planning and coordination, and practical systems for individuals and small businesses in Raleigh–Durham."
accent: copper
---
{% import "partials/components.njk" as c with context %}

<section class="hero hero-page hero-text">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
    <h1>What I help with</h1>
    <p class="lede">Six ways to get important work moving. Most clients start with one.</p>
    <nav class="jump" aria-label="Services on this page">
      {%- for s in services %}<a href="{{ s.link or ('#' + s.slug) }}">{{ s.short }}</a>{% endfor %}
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" aria-label="Service lines">
  <div class="wrap svc-list">
    {%- for s in services %}
    <article class="svc-row" id="{{ s.slug }}">
      <div class="svc-row-head">
        <span class="svc-num" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index }}</span>
        <h2>{{ s.name }}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-row-body">
        <p class="svc-summary">{{ s.summary }}</p>
        {%- if s.detail %}<p>{{ s.detail }}</p>{% endif %}
        {%- if s.goodFit %}<p class="fit"><b>Good fit if</b> {{ s.goodFit }}</p>{% endif %}
        {%- if s.link %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ s.link }}">See the notary page for details</a>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band-stone" aria-labelledby="eng-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Ways to work together</p>
      <h2 id="eng-h">Engagement types</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="eng-grid">
      <div class="eng"><h3>A single session</h3><p>Two hours, one focused problem, and a clean one-page plan you leave with.</p></div>
      <div class="eng"><h3>A project</h3><p>Defined work, a defined outcome, and a timeline.</p></div>
      <div class="eng"><h3>Ongoing support</h3><p>Regular time each month for planning, coordination, and keeping work moving.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pricing-note">
      <h3>On pricing</h3>
      <p>Engagements range from a single two-hour session to ongoing monthly support. I'll give you a clear price after we talk about what you need. No packages you have to squeeze into.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band cta-band" aria-labelledby="svc-cta-h">
  <div class="wrap cta-in">
    <h2 id="svc-cta-h">Tell me what you're working on</h2>
    <p>Send a note, or book a time to talk it through.</p>
    <div class="actions center">
      <a class="btn btn-dark" href="/contact/">Tell me what you're working on <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      {{ c.booking("consulting", "Book a call", "btn-line") }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
